--- !u!114 &955192952
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 955192949}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 80c3b1316db4a3e48aa83df2c8f3f9b0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AssistantController
  audioSource: {fileID: 955192954}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 163793495}
  gameStateController: {fileID: 1681669335}
  officeIntroLines:
  - text: "Ah, you must be today\u2019s new Sleep Organizer! I\u2019m your assistant."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bb8d5dc745e81d34b831e918fc516a65, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "See the person on the computer screen? That\u2019s our first client for
      today, and he\u2019s already deep asleep. Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll walk
      you through every step."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eab48a8d1909e4b429216281f44cb33b, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "When you\u2019re ready, place your hand on this crystal ball. We\u2019re
      heading into his subconscious together!"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdf3135fd12b83d4b8fe53673762f89b, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  hippocampusIntroLines:
  - text: "Alright, we\u2019re inside the client\u2019s subconscious now."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8cc8bd99083038e4aa8472794ef5d794, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: This room is built from his memories. Every object here represents something
      precious from his life.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd90541b22a74eb4b8d7d9646a825db0, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Our job right now is to take the memory represented by this water bottle
      on the table, and put it where it belongs.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43d09b548e193ec458702e905209699d, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  memoryRevealedLines:
  - text: Ohhh, so this thermos means he was sick today and needed medicine and water.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 150cefabdb96cc24795a955d8c4a5a4a, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Hm. Yeah\u2026 that doesn\u2019t exactly sound like a happy little memory."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3707ce6fd3191ab41ae0c71913e30aa1, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  memoryPlacementHintLines:
  - text: "I don\u2019t think this memory needs to stay around forever. Let\u2019s
      put it in that box at the back, the one for short-term memories."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac45213f3b611af4c91938cad14c5e3f, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  nightmareWarningLines:
  - text: Did you hear that? What was that sound?
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 932b82c5cc7cfe34fa3147d8d91d52b8, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Uh-oh. I\u2019m detecting emotional instability. His heart rate is rising.
      Is he having a nightmare?"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cab3fc4cca1559478d6c8a3d1955fc0, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Wait, what is that thing? That monster is absolutely not supposed to be
      here!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b4a91b7a4eae304abf6f93d1a3665d5, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  swallowTransitionLines:
  - text: "Oh my gosh, we\u2019re about to get eaten by this thing! Oh no no no!
      Wait\u2026 "
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24b169ebc324f7c43b25f90405c1c509, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "huh? I think I\u2019m falling. And weirdly enough, the inside of this
      monster feels\u2026 kind of safe?"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73ed07d48802bab4f98d6789463f9897, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  mirrorChamberIntroLines:
  - text: "I landed safely! I\u2019ll be waiting for you down here."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d3ec845a04a10174b8e2cf71a1e721d8, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "It looks like this monster is made from a lot of painful memories the
      client just couldn\u2019t forget. We need to find a way to help him."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8bfa03b11859164dae8931520eabd10, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  breakGlassLines:
  - text: Look! That glass is holding a bunch of objects tied to negative emotions
      and painful memories.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68fcf3c7d66646544a3256defe38d1e9, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: I think all we need to do is smash it. Therapeutic? Maybe. Effective? Definitely!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2774120efdece994ca837ee6239550c4, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  glassBrokenPraiseLines:
  - text: That was amazing! You broke the glass!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8f55c20d2e599549a4911ff77fc9915, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "I\u2019m detecting that the client\u2019s emotions have stabilized now.
      Very nice work, tiny hero of the subconscious."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf39f61b0879cd747b56b66602552a70, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  returnToOfficeLines:
  - text: I can take us back to the office now. You handled your very first job wonderfully.
      Congratulations!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a3bcbe62e04e544ab3294625b212773, type: 3}
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
